<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:b01b9fac9b9fe9b76c454cdc702f05edc54148915fcf35812306ad1c00ae43dd> <https://example.org/slice/text> "4. The lagoon is warm to the depth of an arm, and it keeps the colour\nof weak tea until the afternoon wind turns it the colour of slate." .
