<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:1c847b83ac6ff936e15b5df2366b920c9a69cfcf25834fc40131f8bfab96e06e> <https://example.org/slice/text> "5. The shell middens on the south bar are older than the landing, and\nno survey has counted them; the café on the quay sells the smaller ones\nto visitors, which is one reason the count keeps falling every season." .
